Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Tags|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Auto Assertion Tag Via Blogs
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|testray.component.names|Blogs,Tags|
	When ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Site add Blank CP
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Sites
		|portlet|Sites|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Tags|
	And Tag add CP
		|tagName|tag name 1|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Tags|
	And Tag add CP
		|tagName|tag name 2|
	And Navigator open Site URL
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Tags|
	And Tag add CP
		|tagName|tag name 3|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Blogs|
	And Navigator goto Site Page
		|pageName|Page Name|
		|siteName|Site Name|
	And Tag add Auto Assertion Tag Via Blogs PG
		|entryContent|Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Entry Title|
		|tagName|tag name 3|
	And BlogsNavigator goto Entry PG
		|entryContent|Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Entry Title|
	Then BlogsEntry view Tag PG
		|entryContent|Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Entry Title|
		|tagName|tag name 3|
