	And TagsNavigationPortlet configure Flaggable Settings PG
		|showAssetCount|true|
		|showUnusedTags|true|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Tags Navigation Page|
	And TagsNavigationPortlet configure Display Style PG
		|displayTemplate|Cloud|
